{"id":8182149,"docketId":65279769,"caseName":"Workin v. United States","caseNameFull":"Isadore Workin v. United States","slug":"workin-v-united-states","docketNumber":"No. 115","dateFiled":"1920-12-13","dateArgued":null,"dateCertGranted":null,"year":1920,"scdbId":"","direction":"","votesMajority":null,"votesMinority":null,"disposition":"","posture":"","syllabus":null,"summary":null,"headnotes":null,"proceduralHistory":null,"attorneys":null,"natureOfSuit":"","citationCount":0,"judges":"","jurisdictionType":"","opinions":[{"id":8144068,"type":"majority","typeCode":"020lead","perCuriam":false,"author":"","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":1438,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"majority\">\n<p id=\"Akgu\">Error to the Circuit Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit. Submitted December 9, 1920. Decided December 13, 1920. <em>Per Curiam. </em>Dismissed for want of jurisdiction upon the authority of <em>Macfadden </em>v. <em>United States, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"97015\"><a href=\"/opinion/97015/macfadden-v-united-states/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: MacFadden v. United States\">213 U. S. 288</a></span>. And see <em>Boise Water Co. </em>v. <em>Boise City, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"97954\"><a href=\"/opinion/97954/boise-artesian-hot-cold-water-co-v-boise-city/#100\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Boise Artesian Hot &amp; Cold Water Co. v. Boise City\">230 U. S. 98, 100</a></span>; <em>Chott </em>v. <em>Ewing, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"98430\"><a href=\"/opinion/98430/united-states-ex-rel-chott-v-ewing/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: United States Ex Rel. Chott v. Ewing\">237 U. S. 197</a></span>; <em>Alaska Pacific Fisheries </em>v. <em>Alaska, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"99297\"><a href=\"/opinion/99297/alaska-pacific-fisheries-v-territory-of-alaska/#60\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Alaska Pacific Fisheries v. Territory of Alaska\">249 U. S. 53, 60-61</a></span>. <em>M